ates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Formal vs. Informal Language", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use formal words and expressions in some situations, like making reservations or polite requests at a restaurant. You can use modals of request in these situations. <br>  <br>You respond to formal requests in a polite way. If you do not know the person's name, you say Sir, Madam, or Miss.</br>  <br>You use informal or casual words and expressions when you speak to your friends or family.</br>   <br>Remember to be polite!", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Formal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Informal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Making Requests\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could I \u2026 ?<br> May I \u2026 ?<br> Would you like to \u2026 ?<br> Excuse me \u2026 ?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can I/you \u2026 ?<br> Do you want to \u2026 ?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to Requests\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Certainly, Sir/Madam.<br> Absolutely.<br> You are very welcome.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sure.<br> No problem.<br> You're welcome.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Hey, can you send the invitations, please?<br><span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: Sure, Ann. No problem.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Excuse me, could I sit by the bar?<br><span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Certainly, Miss. This way, please.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "party ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a group of people ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is a party of four under Mr. Smith.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le08ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you make a reservation.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "at the bar ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the area in a restaurant where you order drinks ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can we sit at the bar?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le08ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "by the window ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a table near the window ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'd like to sit by the window, please.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le08ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "You're very welcome", "type": "name"}, {"content": "when you respond to someone saying thanks ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You're very welcome, Sir.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le08ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "certain